    "overview": "Compare a city report and a resident's letter about the same project, and explain where and why they disagree.",
    "prompt": "Read \"Opening the Creek\" and \"A Creek for Whom?\" Write an explanatory essay that identifies two places where the texts disagree, on a matter of fact or of interpretation. For each, quote both sources, explain the disagreement, and suggest why the two writers see it differently (think about what each one measured, and who each one counted). End by explaining what a reader should know before deciding whether the project succeeded.",
